# Doc alignment ledger. scripts/check-doc-alignment.sh exits 0 only when every row holds.
# R id path phrase    the file must contain the phrase
# F id path phrase    the file must not contain the phrase
# T id path phrase    a behavior test or the implementing script contains the phrase
# S script.sh         every templates/.agents-v0/ci/*.sh is listed
# C v0-name.md        every core/common/commands/v0-*.md is listed
# H hash script.sh    every non-comment FAIL: line in those scripts is listed
# Exit 0 means these proved sentences match, and every CI script, phase command, and FAIL: line is listed.
# A new script, command, or FAIL: line fails this check until its row is added. Pack skills no command names are outside it.
R	event-na	core/common/commands/v0-design.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	core/common/skills/contract-first-design/SKILL.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	core/common/agents/solution-architect.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	templates/docs/agents-v0/agents-v0-kit.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	templates/docs/agents-v0/design/_design.template.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	templates/.agents-v0/ci/check-design.sh	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	core/common/commands/v0-build.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	templates/docs/agents-v0/greenfield-onboarding.md	N/A: no event contract
R	event-na	templates/docs/agents-v0/milestones/p0-platform-skeleton.md	N/A: no event contract
R	public-marker	core/common/commands/v0-design.md	pack public marker
R	public-marker	templates/.agents-v0/ci/check-design.sh	publicMarker
R	whole-module	core/common/rules/quality-and-testing.mdc	Whole-module lines
R	whole-module	core/common/commands/v0-verify.md	Whole-module lines
R	whole-module	core/common/skills/quality-gate/SKILL.md	Whole-module lines
R	whole-module	templates/docs/agents-v0/quality-gates.md	Whole-module lines
R	whole-module	templates/docs/agents-v0/agents-v0-kit.md	Whole-module lines
R	whole-module	README.md	Whole-module lines
R	whole-module	templates/.agents-v0/ci/check-gate-metrics.sh	whole-module
R	jacoco-080	core/java/starters/maven/quality-plugins.xml	<minimum>0.80</minimum>
R	jacoco-080	core/common/rules/quality-and-testing.mdc	does not change that minimum
R	jacoco-080	templates/docs/agents-v0/quality-gates.md	does not change the JaCoCo 0.80 gate
R	jacoco-080	templates/docs/agents-v0/brownfield-onboarding.md	does not relax Pack `java` verify
R	changed-lines	templates/docs/agents-v0/quality-gates.md	Changed lines
R	changed-lines	core/common/rules/quality-and-testing.mdc	Changed lines threshold
R	changed-lines	templates/.agents-v0/ci/check-gate-metrics.sh	quality-gates.md
F	event-na	templates/docs/agents-v0/design/_design.template.md	does not look for that phrase
F	event-na	core/common/commands/v0-design.md	does not look for that phrase
F	public-marker	core/common/commands/v0-design.md	any `permitAll` is only
F	whole-module	README.md	fails only when the pack wires it
F	whole-module	core/common/rules/quality-and-testing.mdc	fails only when the pack wires it
F	whole-module	templates/docs/agents-v0/agents-v0-kit.md	fails only when the pack wires it
T	event-na	scripts/test-design-build.sh	no event contract without the N/A phrase fails
T	public-marker	scripts/test-design-build.sh	AllowAnonymous on a non-health route needs a review
T	changed-lines	scripts/test-ci-checks.sh	diff coverage 50% fails the default 80%
T	jacoco-080	scripts/test-ci-checks.sh	coverage ratchet: LINE_COVERAGE_PCT meets interim minimum
